{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40531","headline":"感旧诗 · 路德延","name":"感旧诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初骑竹马咏芭蕉，尝忝名卿诵满朝。\n五字便容趋绦帐，一枝寻许折丹霄。\n岂知流落萍蓬远，不觉推迁岁月遥。\n国境未安身未立，至今颜巷守箪瓢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"路德延","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40531.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40531","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}